# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-raging
name: Raging
polarity: positive
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: number
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  In the Raging State, Wound Rolls +2(T).
text: >
  Raging: This Transformation is conducive to an aggressive state of mind.
  –Effect: While in the Raging State, increase your Wound Rolls by 2(T).

---

# In the Raging State: Wound 2(T) - the Superior State too where a Trait says to treat it as Raging for this Aspect (superiorAsRaging).
[passive]
if (inState("raging") || (inState("superior") && superiorAsRaging)) {
    wound += 2(T);
}
